      },
      {
       "s": "At mony a house.”[^2]",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 76,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“Ay, ay!” quo’ he, an’ shook his head,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "“It’s e’en a lang, lang time indeed",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Sin’ I began to nick the thread,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "An’ choke the breath:",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Folk maun do something for their bread,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "An’ sae maun Death.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 76,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“Sax thousand years are near-hand fled",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Sin’ I was to the butching bred,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "An’ mony a scheme in vain’s been laid,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "To stap or scar me;",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Till ane Hornbook’s[^3] ta’en up the trade,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And faith! he’ll waur me.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 76,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“Ye ken Jock Hornbook i’ the clachan,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Deil mak his king’s-hood in a spleuchan!",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "He’s grown sae weel acquaint wi’ Buchan[^4]",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And ither chaps,",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "The weans haud out their fingers laughin,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "An’ pouk my hips.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 76,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“See, here’s a scythe, an’ there’s a dart,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "They hae pierc’d mony a gallant heart;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "But Doctor Hornbook, wi’ his art",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "An’ cursed skill,",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Has made them baith no worth a f—t,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Damn’d haet they’ll kill!",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 76,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“ ’Twas but yestreen, nae farther gane,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "I threw a noble throw at ane;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Wi’ less, I’m sure, I’ve hundreds slain;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "But deil-ma-care,",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "It just play’d dirl on the bane,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "But did nae mair.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 76,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“Hornbook was by, wi’ ready art,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "An’ had sae fortify’d the part,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "That when I lookèd to my dart,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "It was sae blunt,",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Fient haet o’t wad hae pierc’d the heart",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Of a kail-runt.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 77,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“I drew my scythe in sic a fury,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "I near-hand cowpit wi’ my hurry,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "But yet the bauld Apothecary",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Withstood the shock;",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "I might as weel hae tried a quarry",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "O’ hard whin rock.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 77,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“Ev’n them he canna get attended,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Altho’ their face he ne’er had kend it,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Just——in a kail-blade, an’ send it,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "As soon’s he smells ‘t,",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Baith their disease, and what will mend it,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "At once he tells ’t.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 77,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“And then, a’ doctor’s saws an’ whittles,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Of a’ dimensions, shapes, an’ mettles,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "A’ kind o’ boxes, mugs, an’ bottles,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "He’s sure to hae;",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Their Latin names as fast he rattles",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "As A B C.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 77,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“Calces o’ fossils, earths, and trees;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "True sal-marinum o’ the seas;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "The farina of beans an’ pease,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "He has’t in plenty;",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Aqua-fontis, what you please,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "He can content ye.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 77,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“Forbye some new, uncommon weapons,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Urinus spiritus of capons;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Or mite-horn shavings, filings, scrapings,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Distill’d per se;",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Sal-alkali o’ midge-tail clippings.",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And mony mae.”",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 78,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“Waes me for Johnie Ged’s[^5] Hole now,”",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Quoth I, “if that thae news be true!",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "His braw calf-ward whare gowans grew,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Sae white and bonie,",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Nae doubt they’ll rive it wi’ the plew;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "They’ll ruin Johnie!”",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 78,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "The creature grain’d an eldritch laugh,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And says “Ye needna yoke the pleugh,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Kirkyards will soon be till’d eneugh,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Tak ye nae fear:",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "They’ll a’ be trench’d wi’ mony a sheugh,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "In twa-three year.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 78,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“Whare I kill’d ane, a fair strae-death,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "By loss o’ blood or want of breath,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "This night I’m free to tak my aith,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "That Hornbook’s skill",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Has clad a score i’ their last claith,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "By drap an’ pill.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 78,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“An honest wabster to his trade,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Whase wife’s twa nieves were scarce weel-bred",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Gat tippence-worth to mend her head,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "When it was sair;",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "The wife slade cannie to her bed,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "But ne’er spak mair.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 78,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“A country laird had ta’en the batts,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Or some curmurring in his guts,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "His only son for Hornbook sets,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "An’ pays him well:",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "The lad, for twa guid gimmer-pets,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Was laird himsel’.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 78,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“A bonie lass—ye kend her name—",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Some ill-brewn drink had hov’d her wame;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "She trusts hersel’, to hide the shame,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "In Hornbook’s care;",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Horn sent her aff to her lang hame,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "To hide it there.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 79,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“That’s just a swatch o’ Hornbook’s way;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Thus goes he on from day to day,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Thus does he poison, kill, an’ slay,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "An’s weel paid for’t;",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Yet stops me o’ my lawfu’ prey,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Wi’ his damn’d dirt:",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 79,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "“But, hark! I’ll tell you of a plot,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Tho’ dinna ye be speakin o’t;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "I’ll nail the self-conceited sot,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "As dead’s a herrin;",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "Neist time we meet, I’ll wad a groat,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "He gets his fairin!”",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 79,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "But just as he began to tell,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "The auld kirk-hammer strak the bell",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Some wee short hour ayont the twal’,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Which rais’d us baith:",
       "i": 8
      },
      {
       "s": "I took the way that pleas’d mysel’,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And sae did Death.",
       "i": 8
      }
     ]
    },
